      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, notice that $2a$ must be parallel to $a$.\n\nNow, for the vector $2a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $2a$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $a$.\n- Vectors $a$ and $2a$ have the same direction since the factor $2$ is positive.\n\nThe required vectors are shown below.\n\n![](generate/scratch/17592186096649/plots/bb32a1efadc1d4394b4df86fd1f2e1e8c20f26b77c89ef85e03f8afcacfa3452.png)"
